  "goodToKnow": "Die Sozialleistung, usually plural Sozialleistungen, is a social or welfare benefit: Bürgergeld, Kindergeld, Wohngeld (housing benefit), Elterngeld. Germany's Sozialstaat (welfare state) is anchored in the Grundgesetz, and social spending makes up about a third of GDP. Die Leistung means performance, achievement, and also benefit or service: Leistungen der Krankenkasse. Plural: die Sozialleistungen."
